                                                "sense_id": "c945a2bf-6c0b-3521-9623-e4038bec2b97",
                                                "text": "\"Got those [sc. scars] with a broken bottle, arresting two toughs at once,\" he said, replacing his cap. \"Run them in single-handed and had a set-to in the cell with them on top of it.\""
                                            }
